{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An exhilarating idle loot-based 3D infinite flow game where you adventure with beautiful waifus !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Idle Looting &amp; Casual Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can freely traverse worlds built from infinite flow worlds\u2014novel realms, movie settings, game universes, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in manual combat or choose idle battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In idle mode, simply sit back and wait to obtain high-tier gear and rare materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight through levels, collect equipment, pets, and skills scattered across different worlds, and strengthen your character through upgrades\u2014pushing forward until the end of all realms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/extras/\u8dd1\u56fe.gif?t=1743570044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/extras/3\u670825\u65e5__2_.gif?t=1743570044\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Maidens' Realm &amp; Bonding System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter numerous magical maidens with distinct personalities in the vast multiverse\u2014these companions will always assist you in auto-battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock a wealth of outfits and skins for free, shareable among all your magical maidens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increase their affection levels, deepen your bonds, and interact with them intimately touch interactions !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/extras/\u6362\u88c5.gif?t=1743570044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/extras/unknown_2025.03.24-16.06.gif?t=1743570044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3205960?t=1743570044","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743570044","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/aae3d2caf010d0897650221359430a4bee171a23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743570044","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/aae3d2caf010d0897650221359430a4bee171a23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743570044","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>contact</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check more\u00a0 information on our discord!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An exhilarating idle loot-based 3D infinite flow game where you adventure with beautiful waifus !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Idle Looting &amp; Casual Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can freely traverse worlds built from infinite flow worlds\u2014novel realms, movie settings, game universes, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in manual combat or choose idle battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In idle mode, simply sit back and wait to obtain high-tier gear and rare materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight through levels, collect equipment, pets, and skills scattered across different worlds, and strengthen your character through upgrades\u2014pushing forward until the end of all realms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/extras/\u8dd1\u56fe.gif?t=1743570044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><im